        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="stop" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3&quot;&gt;ABoomerShooterCharacter::&lt;br&gt;FireInputCancelled()&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;CurrentWeapon 有效 → SetFirePressed(false)。&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;color:#627086;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;Character/BoomerShooterCharacter.cpp:232&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e8f1ff;strokeColor=#5b8fc9;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontColor=#253349;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="630" width="480" height="155" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pressed" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3&quot;&gt;AWeapon::&lt;br&gt;SetFirePressed()&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;只执行 FirePressed = Pressed；&lt;br&gt;没有在此函数中生成子弹。&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;color:#627086;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;Weapon/Weapon.cpp:63&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e6f5ef;strokeColor=#489a79;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontColor=#253349;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="600" y="180" width="480" height="165" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="tick" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3&quot;&gt;AWeapon::&lt;br&gt;Tick()&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;CurrentShootTime = Clamp(时间 + DeltaTime, 0, ShootTime)；&lt;br&gt;FirePressed 且时间 &amp;gt;= ShootTime → 归零并调用 Fire。&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;color:#627086;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;Weapon/Weapon.cpp:264&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e6f5ef;strokeColor=#489a79;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontColor=#253349;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="600" y="410" width="480" height="175" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="fire" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3&quot;&gt;AWeapon::&lt;br&gt;Fire()&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;玩家/控制器有效才继续；播放音效；&lt;br&gt;循环 BulletsPerShot 次，用 SpreadDistance 随机散布；&lt;br&gt;Projectile 有效？生成投射物；否则走射线。&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;color:#627086;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;Weapon/Weapon.cpp:88&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e6f5ef;strokeColor=#489a79;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontColor=#253349;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="600" y="660" width="480" height="205" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="trace" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3&quot;&gt;UWorld::LineTraceSingleByObjectType()&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;从玩家相机到 RayEnd，长度 10000 + 散布；&lt;br&gt;对象类型 Pawn / WorldStatic；忽略玩家；&lt;br&gt;命中 AEnemyCharacter → DamageEnemy(BulletDamage)。&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;color:#627086;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;Weapon/Weapon.cpp:88（Fire 内部射线分支）&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#edf0f5;strokeColor=#8492a6;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontColor=#253349;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1160" y="410" width="480" height="205" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="damage" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3&quot;&gt;AEnemyCharacter::&lt;br&gt;DamageEnemy()&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;Health -= BulletDamage；&lt;br&gt;IsDead() 为真 → 计分 / 清理波次 / Destroy。&lt;br&gt;完整链见 07 页。&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;color:#627086;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;Enemies/EnemyCharacter.cpp:68&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fceaea;strokeColor=#cb7171;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontColor=#253349;" vertex="1" parent="1">
