        <mxCell id="ibegin" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3&quot;&gt;UInteractionPoint::&lt;br&gt;BeginPlay()&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;找到 Player；&lt;br&gt;OnPlayerInteractionPress.AddDynamic&lt;br&gt;绑定 OnPlayerInteractionPressed。&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;color:#627086;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;Level/InteractionPoint.cpp:34&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f2ecfa;strokeColor=#9e85bf;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontColor=#253349;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="180" width="480" height="190" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="itick" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3&quot;&gt;UInteractionPoint::&lt;br&gt;TickComponent()&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;按 InteractDistance 检测 PlayerInRange；&lt;br&gt;首次进入/离开 → 对应 Enter / Exit 委托广播；&lt;br&gt;保存 PlayerInRange 供交互回调读取。&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;color:#627086;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;Level/InteractionPoint.cpp:56&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f2ecfa;strokeColor=#9e85bf;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontColor=#253349;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="440" width="480" height="200" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="interaction" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3&quot;&gt;ABoomerShooterCharacter::&lt;br&gt;Interaction()&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;InteractionAction Triggered 经输入绑定调度；&lt;br&gt;OnPlayerInteractionPress.IsBound()&lt;br&gt;→ Broadcast()。&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;color:#627086;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;Character/BoomerShooterCharacter.cpp:196&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e8f1ff;strokeColor=#5b8fc9;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontColor=#253349;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="710" width="480" height="185" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="pressed" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3&quot;&gt;UInteractionPoint::&lt;br&gt;OnPlayerInteractionPressed()&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;Player 有效且 PlayerInRange，且 Activated 已绑定：&lt;br&gt;OnInteractionPointActivated.Broadcast()；&lt;br&gt;实际开门/机关响应由订阅者决定，需查蓝图。&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;color:#627086;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;Level/InteractionPoint.cpp:42&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f2ecfa;strokeColor=#9e85bf;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontColor=#253349;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="960" width="480" height="210" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="jbegin" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3&quot;&gt;AJumpPad::&lt;br&gt;BeginPlay()&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;缓存玩家；FindComponentByClass(UStaticMeshComponent)；&lt;br&gt;Mesh-&amp;gt;OnComponentBeginOverlap.AddDynamic&lt;br&gt;绑定 OnComponentOverlap。&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;color:#627086;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;Level/JumpPad.cpp:35&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f2ecfa;strokeColor=#9e85bf;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontColor=#253349;" vertex="1" parent="1">
