        <mxCell id="footer" value="当前源码快照 2026-10-11 · 文件位置相对 BoomerShooter/Source/BoomerShooter/ · 未执行 PIE · 阅读顺序见 00 页" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontSize=14;fontColor=#253349;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="1190" width="1640" height="26" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lookbegin" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3&quot;&gt;ULookAtTarget::&lt;br&gt;BeginPlay()&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;缓存 Player；默认目标可使用玩家。&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;color:#627086;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;Utilities/LookAtTarget.cpp:34&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f2ecfa;strokeColor=#9e85bf;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontColor=#253349;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="180" width="480" height="160" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="looktick" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3&quot;&gt;ULookAtTarget::&lt;br&gt;TickComponent()&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;FollowActor 有效则跟随它，否则跟随 Player；&lt;br&gt;LockedZ 将方向 Z 置 0，MakeRotFromXZ；&lt;br&gt;Free 使用 MakeRotFromXY。&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;color:#627086;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;Utilities/LookAtTarget.cpp:40&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f2ecfa;strokeColor=#9e85bf;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontColor=#253349;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="410" width="480" height="205" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="transform" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3&quot;&gt;TransformSelf 的当前代码分支&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;true：OurPosition 使用 Owner 位置，&lt;br&gt;最终 SetWorldRotation（修改此组件）。&lt;br&gt;false：OurPosition 使用组件位置，&lt;br&gt;最终 GetOwner()-&amp;gt;SetActorRotation（修改 Owner）。&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;color:#627086;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;Utilities/LookAtTarget.cpp:40&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f2ecfa;strokeColor=#9e85bf;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontColor=#253349;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="700" width="480" height="220" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="movebegin" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3&quot;&gt;UMoveBetweenPoints::&lt;br&gt;BeginPlay()&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;只调用 Super::BeginPlay()，无额外业务逻辑。&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;color:#627086;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;Utilities/MoveBetweenPoints.cpp:31&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f2ecfa;strokeColor=#9e85bf;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontColor=#253349;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="600" y="180" width="480" height="160" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="movetick" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3&quot;&gt;UMoveBetweenPoints::&lt;br&gt;TickComponent()&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;CurrentMoveTime &amp;gt;= MoveTime → 下一个点并设置 StopTime；&lt;br&gt;索引超出 MovePointsLocal 时回到 0；&lt;br&gt;停留结束 → 累加时间，Lerp 当前相对位置到目标点；&lt;br&gt;最后 CurrentStopTime -= DeltaTime。&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;color:#627086;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;Utilities/MoveBetweenPoints.cpp:36&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f2ecfa;strokeColor=#9e85bf;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontColor=#253349;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="600" y="410" width="480" height="235" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="params" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3&quot;&gt;工具组件参数由资产决定&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;MovePointsLocal / MoveTime / StopTime；&lt;br&gt;FollowActor / Axis / TransformSelf。&lt;br&gt;没有证据证明它们挂载到指定敌人或陷阱。&lt;br&gt;需从实际蓝图组件树核验。&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff4dc;strokeColor=#c99c42;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontColor=#253349;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="600" y="730" width="480" height="220" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="spawnpoint" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3&quot;&gt;AEnemySpawnPoint&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;构造函数启用 Tick；BeginPlay / Tick 只调用 Super。&lt;br&gt;此类主要提供可放置的生成位置/朝向。&lt;br&gt;管理器 SpawnWave 读取 SpawnPoint 的 Transform。&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;color:#627086;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;Enemies/EnemySpawnPoint.cpp:26、31、36&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fceaea;strokeColor=#cb7171;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontColor=#253349;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1160" y="180" width="480" height="205" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="navpoint" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3&quot;&gt;AEnemyNavigationPoint&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;构造函数启用 Tick；BeginPlay / Tick 只调用 Super。&lt;br&gt;C++ 存在该类和蓝图资产；&lt;br&gt;导航实际使用 LineMoverStartPoint / EndPoint 的 AActor 引用，&lt;br&gt;不能仅凭名称确认这两端必须是此类型。&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:13px;color:#627086;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;Enemies/EnemyNavigationPoint.cpp:26、31、36&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fceaea;strokeColor=#cb7171;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontColor=#253349;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1160" y="460" width="480" height="235" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="empty" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:19px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.3&quot;&gt;其他空覆写的阅读定位&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;AEnemyCharacter::Tick / PossessedBy / SetupPlayerInputComponent：&lt;br&gt;仅调用 Super，业务伤害在 DamageEnemy。&lt;br&gt;AJumpPad::Tick：仅 Super；实际跳板逻辑在 Overlap。&lt;br&gt;构造函数主要负责组件创建与默认设置。&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#edf0f5;strokeColor=#8492a6;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=18;spacingRight=18;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontColor=#253349;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1160" y="790" width="480" height="245" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="edge1" value="Player 缓存 / UE 每帧调度" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.8;strokeColor=#8c96a5;fontColor=#42536a;fontSize=14;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;jettySize=auto;dashed=1;dashPattern=1 4;" edge="1" parent="1" source="lookbegin" target="looktick">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1" />
